[{"title":"怀王恒叔十四韵","author":"胡应麟","text":"南迁新命下蓬莱，紫气函关日夜开。\n霞色乍眠方广寺，月华频坐妙高台。\n三山兴尽思三竺，九曲吟成梦九垓。\n瑶圃勒铭推哲匠，玉楼题记仗雄才。\n荧煌赋草传中国，灿烂文芒接上台。\n轵里晨霜流桧柏，茂陵秋雨滴莓苔。\n穷交此夕摅孤愤，故友当年和七哀。\n授简甘泉誇骏骨，飞觚碣石羡鸿裁。\n峥嵘汲郑交难续，嚄唶荆高世尚猜。\n咫尺遮须寻子建，龙门曾识仲宣来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18347,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭苏学使君禹十八韵","author":"胡应麟","text":"皂盖朱幡辟众僚，青鞋白帢问山椒。\n犹思藉草过三洞，尚记看花就六桥。\n刬地雕戈红日驻，倚天长剑白虹飘。\n论心北海尊偏洽，握手西园盖未遥。\n一水骤萦桐柏梦，万峰俄矗桂林标。\n桄榔树色浮公座，豆蔻花香扑使轺。\n玉管暮挥盈洞壑，金函晨捧接烟霄。\n长门斗赋惊先达，宣室纡谈误早朝。\n十日河梁怀并郁，经时濠濮兴难消。\n将因索处寻公叔，讵意飞升逐子乔。\n斋老白杨情漠漠，阁残玄草意萧萧。\n中郎典籍悲零乱，太史篇章恨寂寥。\n蹻蹑五龙飞帝阙，旌悬双鹤度神飙。\n胡床瀔水迷秋月，画舸钱塘咽暮潮。\n国士中原时自惜，名流东域定谁骄。\n遗书百代鸣孤愤，大乐千年閟九韶。\n潦倒酬知肠寸折，不禁寒雨堕深宵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18348,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自桐卢至新安杂咏十六首 其一 石壁","author":"胡应麟","text":"天风吹客衣，削壁远如堕。\n何人扫石来，独抱苍云卧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18349,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自桐卢至新安杂咏十六首 其二 辛夷馆","author":"胡应麟","text":"爱此幽人居，春风满庭户。\n指点辛夷花，忘却来时路。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18350,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自桐卢至新安杂咏十六首 其三 瀑布","author":"胡应麟","text":"亭亭瀑布泉，风吹一千尺。\n朝来海上帆，挂断长虹色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18351,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自桐卢至新安杂咏十六首 其四 方干宅","author":"胡应麟","text":"万山围欲合，一水去仍遥。\n不识方干宅，桃花满路飘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18352,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自桐卢至新安杂咏十六首 其五 谢翱坟","author":"胡应麟","text":"西岩谢翱冢，一径惟莓苔。\n相对鹿麋坐，秋风时自来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18353,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自桐卢至新安杂咏十六首 其六 新安江","author":"胡应麟","text":"苍郊四无人，轻桡荡空碧。\n春江不断流，满柁蘼芜色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18354,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自桐卢至新安杂咏十六首 其七 仙桃岩","author":"胡应麟","text":"绝壁耸精蓝，孤悬五千丈。\n何代武陵人，移家此峰上。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18355,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自桐卢至新安杂咏十六首 其八 胥口","author":"胡应麟","text":"落月溪水寒，漾舟时未己。\n西泠何处村，望望茶烟起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18356,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自桐卢至新安杂咏十六首 其九 北高峰","author":"胡应麟","text":"言寻王子乔，吹笙跨鸾鹤。\n高峰不见人，日暮藤花落。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18357,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自桐卢至新安杂咏十六首 其十 南高峰","author":"胡应麟","text":"维舟北岭下，摇荡青芙蓉。\n欲向南峰去，夕阳千万重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18358,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自桐卢至新安杂咏十六首 其十一 乌石矶","author":"胡应麟","text":"瞥见双白鸥，飞来似相识。\n翩翩欲近人，复溅苔花湿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18359,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自桐卢至新安杂咏十六首 其十二 桃花硖","author":"胡应麟","text":"移舟信江风，沿洄不知暮。\n前村路转遥，系缆桃花渡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18360,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠虚亭廿绝 其一","author":"胡应麟","text":"雨色凝书案，秋阴拂画墙。\n万竿云雾里，知宿几鸾凰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18361,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠虚亭廿绝 其二","author":"胡应麟","text":"上枝凝翠柏，下叶染苍苔。\n莫使王家见，清吟不肯回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18362,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠虚亭廿绝 其三","author":"胡应麟","text":"昨夜凉风起，笙簧满坐幽。\n何当裁万玉，吹尽楚天秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18363,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠虚亭廿绝 其四","author":"胡应麟","text":"霜朝庭耸玉，雨夕院敲金。\n一自淇园后，诗人几废吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18364,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠虚亭廿绝 其五","author":"胡应麟","text":"栖禽藏密筱，斗雀堕高枝。\n老干空千尺，何人写楚辞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18365,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠虚亭廿绝 其六","author":"胡应麟","text":"镂就云门玉，吹成嶰谷音。\n昼日过沧海，蛟龙不敢吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18366,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠虚亭廿绝 其七","author":"胡应麟","text":"鸟雀下前除，幽篁百尺馀。\n昨宵风雨过，寒洒杜陵书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18367,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠虚亭廿绝 其八","author":"胡应麟","text":"野色琴书里，江声枕簟傍。\n恰称幽人卧，湘云昼满床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18368,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠虚亭廿绝 其九","author":"胡应麟","text":"参差临渌水，袅娜拂秋霜。\n忽记文同画，生绡六尺强。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18369,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠虚亭廿绝 其十","author":"胡应麟","text":"涓涓薄暮霜，袅袅经秋雨。\n深院寂无人，丛篁自相语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18370,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠虚亭廿绝 其十一","author":"胡应麟","text":"晋代诸名流，清谈自相诧。\n何如阮嗣宗，长啸深林下。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18371,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠虚亭廿绝 其十二","author":"胡应麟","text":"倚阑无俗事，解带自清吟。\n一雨朝来霁，千竿翠欲沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18372,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠虚亭廿绝 其十三","author":"胡应麟","text":"萎蕤紫翠间，珍禽自游戏。\n何当觅羽人，共跨青鸾去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18373,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠虚亭廿绝 其十四","author":"胡应麟","text":"閒来晚翠亭，四壁皆清玩。\n传声王丈人，更致蕲州簟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18374,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠虚亭廿绝 其十五","author":"胡应麟","text":"缥缈碧琅玕，森沉下彩鸾。\n佳人翠袖薄，日暮不胜寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18375,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠虚亭廿绝 其十六","author":"胡应麟","text":"截作箫君管，携来弄玉家。\n一吟双凤举，白日赴青霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18376,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题翠虚亭廿绝 其十七","author":"胡应麟","text":"迢遥风雨夜，卧此一窗幽。\n恰似扬舲日，潇湘两岸秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18377,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫怨二首 其一","author":"胡应麟","text":"罗幌寂无人，玉阶秋草绿。\n永夜不成眠，飞萤照华屋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18378,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫怨二首 其二","author":"胡应麟","text":"学得琵琶曲，深宫不忍弹。\n水晶帘幕下，寂寂倚阑干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18379,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日斋居杂咏八首 其一 阳春馆","author":"胡应麟","text":"一雨过修篁，微风动清夏。\n万籁昼萧然，援琴北窗下。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18380,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日斋居杂咏八首 其二 绿筠轩","author":"胡应麟","text":"独坐清风里，流云湿画栏。\n空斋无长物，十万紫琅玕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18381,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日斋居杂咏八首 其三 漱芳池","author":"胡应麟","text":"明月照芳池，倒景浴层嶂。\n文鱼不畏人，竞出沧波上。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18382,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日斋居杂咏八首 其四 驭风亭","aut