thor":"胡应麟","text":"折取三花归，琉璃贮春碧。\n三十六峰云，昼绕维摩室。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18402,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"笛","author":"胡应麟","text":"手挽铁龙君，登楼唤黄鹤。\n万顷碧天空，梅花何处落。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18403,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茶灶","author":"胡应麟","text":"夜凉起南轩，然藜煮雀舌。\n山童荷担归，满瓮严陵月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18404,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杖","author":"胡应麟","text":"青藜携作杖，霞色照人明。\n偶过刘中垒，翻疑太乙精。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18405,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"琴石","author":"胡应麟","text":"何年空林中，置此太古石。\n岁远莓苔深，片云无处觅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18406,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"博山垆","author":"胡应麟","text":"月影下苍苔，闭门无剥啄。\n白云一缕高，幽人卧初觉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18407,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"麈尾","author":"胡应麟","text":"玉柄蟠蛟螭，隐见前朝字。\n逍遥七百言，花照瓦棺寺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18408,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"羽扇","author":"胡应麟","text":"羽扇白纶巾，寥寥坐清宴。\n千秋广武军，谁知阮公叹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18409,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芒屩","author":"胡应麟","text":"足下两青鞋，他时作何状。\n白日五龙飞，昆崙三万丈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18410,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧室四咏 其一 芙蓉帐","author":"胡应麟","text":"梦寐青莲诗，千篇谢雕饰。\n却笑江文通，花生景纯笔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18411,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧室四咏 其二 湘竹簟","author":"胡应麟","text":"携来六尺云，恰称衡门夜。\n一枕洞庭秋，万山明月下。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18412,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧室四咏 其三 胡床","author":"胡应麟","text":"散发踞胡床，徐看白云过。\n时有鹿麋来，胡床相对坐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18413,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧室四咏 其四 石枕","author":"胡应麟","text":"至人本无梦，何者蕉中鹿。\n松风满石阑，任意黄梁熟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18414,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游囊杂咏五首 其一 蜡屐","author":"胡应麟","text":"长物不随身，周游信双屐。\n中天泰华云，绝顶蓬莱日。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18415,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游囊杂咏五首 其二 席帽","author":"胡应麟","text":"秋风饭颗巅，吟成一登眺。\n日暮谪仙来，相逢应大笑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18416,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游囊杂咏五首 其三 如意","author":"胡应麟","text":"摩挲三尺锋，虬龙挂寒铁。\n万古英雄心，歌成唾壶缺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18417,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游囊杂咏五首 其四 布裘","author":"胡应麟","text":"清晨偶出山，一衲挂枯树。\n向晚白云深，蒙茸不知处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18418,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游囊杂咏五首 其五 药壶","author":"胡应麟","text":"五城十二楼，高悬炼金液。\n朝来费长房，误入神仙宅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18419,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日独游兰阴山五绝句 其一 兰阴山","author":"胡应麟","text":"午风吹芒鞋，独往忘日夕。\n指点山阿人，衡门在萝薜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18420,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日独游兰阴山五绝句 其二 西樵岭","author":"胡应麟","text":"落景留空山，无人自来往。\n一片白云中，时闻樵语响。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18421,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日独游兰阴山五绝句 其三 圣罗庵","author":"胡应麟","text":"一钵坐禅床，清斋自朝暮。\n经年不出门，忘却前峰路。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18422,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日独游兰阴山五绝句 其四 显教寺","author":"胡应麟","text":"探奇兴不尽，秋思满林薄。\n祇园掩夕阳，小坐昙花落。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18423,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日独游兰阴山五绝句 其五 龙湫","author":"胡应麟","text":"波光满沙际，夜景湛林樾。\n山僧抱瓮来，摇动潭中月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18424,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杪秋再游兰阴过精舍见前壁间题怅然复书一绝","author":"胡应麟","text":"谢客访石门，杜公怀岘首。\n万古一伤心，无言对樵叟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18425,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]